      "notes": [
        "Use the published `volcello` and `areacello` for volume/area weights; layer thickness is `volcello`/`areacello`, not the `lev_bnds` difference, because partial bottom cells matter. GFDL-ESM4 `volcello` is monthly.",
        "`deptho` is model bathymetry, not true bathymetry; use it or the field fill pattern to decide cells above the sea floor, and report `attrs['area_source']`/`attrs['volume_source']` when they feed an integral."
